---
description: Pillow repository engineering rules for Cursor agents
globs: "**/*"
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow the root `AGENTS.md` in this repository.

Pillow is self-contained for product work: build, test, and code changes must
not assume an external session bridge, shared vault wiki, or sibling legacy
resource manager.

Maintainer-only orchestration (local session recording, multi-profile CLI
isolation) is outside the product contract. Do not invent vault QUERY/INGEST
steps or absolute paths outside this repository unless a task file in-tree
explicitly requires a named recorded fact.
